 "1": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 400\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Block diagram of the basic processing unit: main memory connected through MAR and MDR to the internal processor bus, which links PC, IR, the registers and the ALU; the control unit decodes the opcode in IR. Numbered steps 1 to 4 mark the instruction fetch.\">\n          <defs>\n            <marker id=\"ar41\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker>\n            <marker id=\"ar41b\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\"/></marker>\n          </defs>\n          <rect x=\"16\" y=\"56\" width=\"104\" height=\"274\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"68\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Main</text>\n          <text x=\"68\" y=\"102\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">memory</text>\n          <text x=\"68\" y=\"182\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">at 2000</text>\n          <rect x=\"26\" y=\"190\" width=\"84\" height=\"34\" rx=\"4\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:1.5\"/>\n          <text x=\"68\" y=\"212\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Add R1,R2</text>\n          <rect x=\"196\" y=\"16\" width=\"508\" height=\"332\" rx=\"12\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5;stroke-dasharray:6 5\"/>\n          <text x=\"212\" y=\"40\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"currentColor\">Processor</text>\n          <text x=\"348\" y=\"44\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">internal processor bus</text>\n          <line x1=\"336\" y1=\"56\" x2=\"336\" y2=\"290\" style=\"stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:8;stroke-linecap:round\"/>\n          <rect x=\"212\" y=\"72\" width=\"84\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"254\" y=\"97\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">MAR</text>\n          <rect x=\"212\" y=\"196\" width=\"84\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"254\" y=\"221\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">MDR</text>\n          <line x1=\"331\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"299\" y2=\"92\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ar41b)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"299\" y1=\"216\" x2=\"331\" y2=\"216\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ar41b)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"212\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"123\" y2=\"92\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar41)\"/>\n          <text x=\"166\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">address</text>\n          <line x1=\"123\" y1=\"216\" x2=\"209\" y2=\"216\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2.5\" marker-start=\"url(#ar41b)\" marker-end=\"url(#ar41b)\"/>\n          <text x=\"166\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">data</text>\n          <rect x=\"376\" y=\"56\" width=\"110\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"431\" y=\"81\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">PC</text>\n          <rect x=\"376\" y=\"116\" width=\"110\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"431\" y=\"141\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">IR</text>\n          <rect x=\"376\" y=\"176\" width=\"110\" height=\"60\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"431\" y=\"202\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">R0 … Rn−1</text>\n          <text x=\"431\" y=\"222\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">registers</text>\n          <rect x=\"376\" y=\"252\" width=\"110\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"431\" y=\"277\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">ALU</text>\n          <line x1=\"342\" y1=\"76\" x2=\"373\" y2=\"76\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-start=\"url(#ar41)\" marker-end=\"url(#ar41)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"342\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"373\" y2=\"136\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ar41b)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"342\" y1=\"206\" x2=\"373\" y2=\"206\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-start=\"url(#ar41)\" marker-end=\"url(#ar41)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"342\" y1=\"272\" x2=\"373\" y2=\"272\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-start=\"url(#ar41)\" marker-end=\"url(#ar41)\"/>\n          <rect x=\"540\" y=\"100\" width=\"150\" height=\"72\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"615\" y=\"130\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Control unit</text>\n          <text x=\"615\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">decodes opcode</text>\n          <line x1=\"486\" y1=\"136\" x2=\"537\" y2=\"136\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar41)\"/>\n          <text x=\"512\" y=\"128\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">opcode</text>\n          <line x1=\"615\" y1=\"172\" x2=\"615\" y2=\"220\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar41)\"/>\n          <text x=\"615\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">control signals</text>\n          <text x=\"615\" y=\"258\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">to every gate</text>\n          <path d=\"M548,175 V318 H123\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-start=\"url(#ar41)\" marker-end=\"url(#ar41)\"/>\n          <text x=\"390\" y=\"310\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">control lines: Read, Write, MFC</text>\n          <circle cx=\"317\" cy=\"70\" r=\"10\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\"/>\n          <text x=\"317\" y=\"75\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--bg)\">1</text>\n          <circle cx=\"166\" cy=\"240\" r=\"10\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\"/>\n          <text x=\"166\" y=\"245\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--bg)\">2</text>\n          <circle cx=\"317\" cy=\"194\" r=\"10\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\"/>\n          <text x=\"317\" y=\"199\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--bg)\">3</text>\n          <circle cx=\"504\" cy=\"62\" r=\"10\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\"/>\n          <text x=\"504\" y=\"67\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--bg)\">4</text>\n          <text x=\"520\" y=\"67\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">PC ← [PC] + 4</text>\n          <text x=\"360\" y=\"380\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">1 MAR ← [PC], Read · 2 wait for MFC · 3 IR ← [MDR] · 4 PC ← [PC] + 4</text>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption><b>Figure 4.1.1</b> The basic processing unit. Only MAR and MDR touch the memory bus. The orange paths are the fetch: (1) PC to MAR, Read; (2) the word at 2000 enters MDR when MFC rises; (3) MDR to IR; (4) PC moves on by 4 during the wait.</figcaption>\n      </figure>",
 "2": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 330\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Input and output gating on a single bus: R1 with R1in and R1out, MDR with MDRout, register Y feeding a multiplexer that also takes the constant 4, the ALU with input B from the bus, and register Z with Zin and Zout. The paths used in step 6 of Add (R3), R1 are highlighted.\">\n          <defs>\n            <marker id=\"ar42\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker>\n            <marker id=\"ar42b\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\"/></marker>\n          </defs>\n          <text x=\"40\" y=\"38\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">internal processor bus</text>\n          <line x1=\"40\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"690\" y2=\"60\" style=\"stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:8;stroke-linecap:round\"/>\n          <rect x=\"40\" y=\"150\" width=\"100\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"90\" y=\"177\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">R1</text>\n          <line x1=\"66\" y1=\"66\" x2=\"66\" y2=\"147\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar42)\"/>\n          <text x=\"60\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\">R1in</text>\n          <line x1=\"116\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"116\" y2=\"67\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar42)\"/>\n          <text x=\"122\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">R1out</text>\n          <rect x=\"196\" y=\"150\" width=\"100\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"246\" y=\"177\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">MDR</text>\n          <line x1=\"246\" y1=\"148\" x2=\"246\" y2=\"67\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ar42b)\"/>\n          <text x=\"252\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">MDRout</text>\n          <line x1=\"246\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"246\" y2=\"197\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar42)\"/>\n          <text x=\"238\" y=\"240\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\">from memory</text>\n          <rect x=\"380\" y=\"96\" width=\"80\" height=\"36\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"420\" y=\"119\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Y</text>\n          <line x1=\"420\" y1=\"66\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"93\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar42)\"/>\n          <text x=\"426\" y=\"84\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">Yin</text>\n          <rect x=\"380\" y=\"160\" width=\"80\" height=\"32\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"420\" y=\"181\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">MUX</text>\n          <line x1=\"420\" y1=\"132\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"157\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ar42b)\"/>\n          <text x=\"330\" y=\"181\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">const 4</text>\n          <line x1=\"358\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"377\" y2=\"176\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar42)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"540\" y1=\"176\" x2=\"463\" y2=\"176\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar42b)\"/>\n          <text x=\"502\" y=\"166\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Select</text>\n          <rect x=\"380\" y=\"222\" width=\"150\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"455\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">ALU</text>\n          <line x1=\"420\" y1=\"192\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"219\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ar42b)\"/>\n          <path d=\"M560,65 V200 H500 V219\" style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ar42b)\"/>\n          <text x=\"566\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">input B</text>\n          <line x1=\"336\" y1=\"258\" x2=\"377\" y2=\"258\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar42)\"/>\n          <text x=\"332\" y=\"263\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\">Add, Sub, …</text>\n          <rect x=\"600\" y=\"222\" width=\"80\" height=\"46\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"640\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Z</text>\n          <line x1=\"530\" y1=\"245\" x2=\"597\" y2=\"245\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ar42b)\"/>\n          <text x=\"563\" y=\"236\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Zin</text>\n          <line x1=\"640\" y1=\"220\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"67\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar42)\"/>\n          <text x=\"646\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">Zout</text>\n          <text x=\"360\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Step 6 of Add (R3), R1: MDRout, SelectY, Add, Zin (orange paths are on)</text>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption><b>Figure 4.2.1</b> Gating on a single bus. In step 6 of Add (R3), R1, MDR drives the bus into ALU input B, the MUX passes Y into input A, and the sum is caught in Z.</figcaption>\n      </figure>",
 "3": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 420\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Two processor organizations side by side. Left: a single bus joining PC, MAR, MDR, IR, the registers, Y, the ALU and Z. Right: three buses A, B and C, with a two-port register file and the ALU reading from A and B and writing to C.\">\n          <defs>\n            <marker id=\"ar43\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker>\n          </defs>\n          <text x=\"180\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Single bus</text>\n          <line x1=\"180\" y1=\"52\" x2=\"180\" y2=\"380\" style=\"stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:8;stroke-linecap:round\"/>\n          <rect x=\"40\" y=\"70\" width=\"96\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"88\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">PC</text>\n          <rect x=\"40\" y=\"130\" width=\"96\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"88\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">MAR</text>\n          <rect x=\"40\" y=\"190\" width=\"96\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"88\" y=\"212\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">MDR</text>\n          <rect x=\"40\" y=\"250\" width=\"96\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"88\" y=\"272\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">IR</text>\n          <line x1=\"139\" y1=\"87\" x2=\"175\" y2=\"87\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-start=\"url(#ar43)\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"175\" y1=\"147\" x2=\"139\" y2=\"147\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"139\" y1=\"207\" x2=\"175\" y2=\"207\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-start=\"url(#ar43)\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"175\" y1=\"267\" x2=\"139\" y2=\"267\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <rect x=\"224\" y=\"70\" width=\"104\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"276\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">R0 … Rn−1</text>\n          <rect x=\"224\" y=\"130\" width=\"104\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"276\" y=\"152\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Y</text>\n          <rect x=\"224\" y=\"190\" width=\"104\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"276\" y=\"217\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">ALU</text>\n          <rect x=\"224\" y=\"260\" width=\"104\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"276\" y=\"282\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Z</text>\n          <line x1=\"185\" y1=\"87\" x2=\"221\" y2=\"87\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-start=\"url(#ar43)\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"185\" y1=\"147\" x2=\"221\" y2=\"147\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"276\" y1=\"164\" x2=\"276\" y2=\"187\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"185\" y1=\"222\" x2=\"221\" y2=\"222\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"276\" y1=\"234\" x2=\"276\" y2=\"257\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"224\" y1=\"277\" x2=\"186\" y2=\"277\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <text x=\"180\" y=\"404\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Add R4, R5, R6 takes 6 steps</text>\n          <line x1=\"360\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"400\" style=\"stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:1.5;stroke-dasharray:6 5\"/>\n          <text x=\"544\" y=\"30\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Three buses</text>\n          <line x1=\"404\" y1=\"58\" x2=\"404\" y2=\"380\" style=\"stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:6;stroke-linecap:round\"/>\n          <line x1=\"444\" y1=\"58\" x2=\"444\" y2=\"380\" style=\"stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:6;stroke-linecap:round\"/>\n          <line x1=\"684\" y1=\"58\" x2=\"684\" y2=\"380\" style=\"stroke:var(--line2);stroke-width:6;stroke-linecap:round\"/>\n          <text x=\"404\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">A</text>\n          <text x=\"444\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">B</text>\n          <text x=\"684\" y=\"52\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">C</text>\n          <rect x=\"484\" y=\"66\" width=\"130\" height=\"60\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"549\" y=\"92\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Register file</text>\n          <text x=\"549\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">2 out, 1 in</text>\n          <rect x=\"484\" y=\"150\" width=\"130\" height=\"50\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"549\" y=\"180\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">ALU</text>\n          <rect x=\"484\" y=\"224\" width=\"130\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"549\" y=\"246\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">PC + incrementer</text>\n          <rect x=\"484\" y=\"282\" width=\"60\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"514\" y=\"304\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">MDR</text>\n          <rect x=\"554\" y=\"282\" width=\"60\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"584\" y=\"304\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">MAR</text>\n          <rect x=\"484\" y=\"340\" width=\"130\" height=\"34\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"549\" y=\"362\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">IR</text>\n          <line x1=\"482\" y1=\"84\" x2=\"409\" y2=\"84\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"482\" y1=\"110\" x2=\"449\" y2=\"110\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"679\" y1=\"96\" x2=\"617\" y2=\"96\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"409\" y1=\"162\" x2=\"481\" y2=\"162\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"449\" y1=\"188\" x2=\"481\" y2=\"188\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"614\" y1=\"175\" x2=\"679\" y2=\"175\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"482\" y1=\"241\" x2=\"449\" y2=\"241\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"679\" y1=\"241\" x2=\"617\" y2=\"241\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"482\" y1=\"299\" x2=\"449\" y2=\"299\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"679\" y1=\"299\" x2=\"617\" y2=\"299\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <line x1=\"679\" y1=\"357\" x2=\"617\" y2=\"357\" style=\"stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\" marker-end=\"url(#ar43)\"/>\n          <text x=\"544\" y=\"404\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Add R4, R5, R6 takes 4 steps</text>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption><b>Figure 4.3.1</b> Left: one bus, so the ALU's first operand must wait in Y and its result in Z. Right: three buses; the register file puts two operands on buses A and B in the same step and the ALU writes the result to bus C (orange). Sources sit on A and B, destinations on C.</figcaption>\n      </figure>",
 "4": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 430\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Single-cycle MIPS datapath: PC, instruction memory, register file, sign-extend, ALUSrc multiplexer, ALU, data memory and MemtoReg multiplexer along the main row; above them the PC plus 4 adder, shift-left-2, branch adder and PCSrc multiplexer. Control signals are marked in orange.\">\n          <defs>\n            <marker id=\"ar44\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker>\n          </defs>\n          <rect x=\"24\" y=\"212\" width=\"46\" height=\"40\" rx=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"47\" y=\"237\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">PC</text>\n          <rect x=\"88\" y=\"192\" width=\"90\" height=\"84\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"133\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Instruction</text>\n          <text x=\"133\" y=\"248\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">memory</text>\n          <rect x=\"88\" y=\"36\" width=\"90\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"133\" y=\"61\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">PC + 4</text>\n          <rect x=\"240\" y=\"184\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"290\" y=\"208\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Registers</text>\n          <text x=\"290\" y=\"230\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">read rs, rt</text>\n          <text x=\"290\" y=\"250\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">write rt/rd</text>\n          <text x=\"290\" y=\"272\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\">RegWrite</text>\n          <ellipse cx=\"278\" cy=\"150\" rx=\"42\" ry=\"18\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"278\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">sign-ext</text>\n          <rect x=\"400\" y=\"136\" width=\"56\" height=\"28\" rx=\"5\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"428\" y=\"155\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">&lt;&lt; 2</text>\n          <rect x=\"476\" y=\"94\" width=\"90\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"521\" y=\"119\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Branch add</text>\n          <rect x=\"590\" y=\"36\" width=\"24\" height=\"100\" rx=\"12\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"602\" y=\"154\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\">PCSrc</text>\n          <rect x=\"372\" y=\"236\" width=\"24\" height=\"80\" rx=\"12\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"384\" y=\"332\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\">ALUSrc</text>\n          <rect x=\"430\" y=\"190\" width=\"70\" height=\"100\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"465\" y=\"242\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">ALU</text>\n          <text x=\"465\" y=\"262\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\">ALUOp</text>\n          <text x=\"494\" y=\"207\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\">Zero</text>\n          <rect x=\"544\" y=\"200\" width=\"80\" height=\"96\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"584\" y=\"224\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Data</text>\n          <text x=\"584\" y=\"242\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">memory</text>\n          <text x=\"584\" y=\"266\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\">MemRead</text>\n          <text x=\"584\" y=\"284\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\">MemWrite</text>\n          <rect x=\"650\" y=\"206\" width=\"24\" height=\"84\" rx=\"12\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"662\" y=\"312\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\">MemtoReg</text>\n          <g style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\">\n            <line x1=\"70\" y1=\"232\" x2=\"85\" y2=\"232\" marker-end=\"url(#ar44)\"/>\n            <path d=\"M47,212 V56 H85\" marker-end=\"url(#ar44)\"/>\n            <path d=\"M178,56 H587\" marker-end=\"url(#ar44)\"/>\n            <path d=\"M440,56 V106 H473\" marker-end=\"url(#ar44)\"/>\n            <path d=\"M133,192 V150 H233\" marker-end=\"url(#ar44)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"320\" y1=\"150\" x2=\"397\" y2=\"150\" marker-end=\"url(#ar44)\"/>\n            <path d=\"M384,150 V233\" marker-end=\"url(#ar44)\"/>\n            <path d=\"M456,150 H464 V122 H473\" marker-end=\"url(#ar44)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"566\" y1=\"114\" x2=\"587\" y2=\"114\" marker-end=\"url(#ar44)\"/>\n            <path d=\"M614,86 H640 V18 H12 V232 H21\" marker-end=\"url(#ar44)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"178\" y1=\"232\" x2=\"237\" y2=\"232\" marker-end=\"url(#ar44)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"340\" y1=\"206\" x2=\"427\" y2=\"206\" marker-end=\"url(#ar44)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"340\" y1=\"262\" x2=\"369\" y2=\"262\" marker-end=\"url(#ar44)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"396\" y1=\"276\" x2=\"427\" y2=\"276\" marker-end=\"url(#ar44)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"500\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"515\" y2=\"200\" marker-end=\"url(#ar44)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"500\" y1=\"250\" x2=\"541\" y2=\"250\" marker-end=\"url(#ar44)\"/>\n            <path d=\"M524,250 V184 H636 V226 H647\" marker-end=\"url(#ar44)\"/>\n            <path d=\"M352,262 V344 H532 V280 H541\" marker-end=\"url(#ar44)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"624\" y1=\"270\" x2=\"647\" y2=\"270\" marker-end=\"url(#ar44)\"/>\n            <path d=\"M674,248 H700 V384 H222 V270 H237\" marker-end=\"url(#ar44)\"/>\n          </g>\n          <g style=\"fill:var(--accent)\">\n            <circle cx=\"440\" cy=\"56\" r=\"3.5\"/><circle cx=\"384\" cy=\"150\" r=\"3.5\"/><circle cx=\"352\" cy=\"262\" r=\"3.5\"/><circle cx=\"524\" cy=\"250\" r=\"3.5\"/>\n          </g>\n          <text x=\"186\" y=\"142\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">imm</text>\n          <text x=\"208\" y=\"224\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">rs rt rd</text>\n          <text x=\"208\" y=\"252\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\">RegDst</text>\n          <text x=\"440\" y=\"362\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">store data (sw)</text>\n          <text x=\"460\" y=\"402\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">write-back data to the register file</text>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption><b>Figure 4.4.1</b> A single-cycle datapath for the MIPS subset. Data flows left to right: fetch, register read, ALU, data memory, write back along the bottom. The four rounded bars are multiplexers, each named by its control signal (orange). PCSrc = Branch AND Zero chooses PC + 4 or the branch target.</figcaption>\n      </figure>",
 "5": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 390\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Hardwired control unit: the clock drives a control step counter, whose step decoder gives T1 to Tn; IR feeds an instruction decoder giving INS1 to INSm; both, with condition codes and external inputs, enter an encoder that outputs control signals such as PCout, MARin, Read, Zin, Zout and End; End loops back to reset the counter.\">\n          <defs>\n            <marker id=\"ar45\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker>\n            <marker id=\"ar45b\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\"/></marker>\n          </defs>\n          <text x=\"110\" y=\"32\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Clock</text>\n          <text x=\"198\" y=\"46\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">Reset</text>\n          <text x=\"36\" y=\"74\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Run</text>\n          <rect x=\"60\" y=\"60\" width=\"180\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"150\" y=\"87\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Control step counter</text>\n          <rect x=\"60\" y=\"130\" width=\"180\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"150\" y=\"157\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Step decoder</text>\n          <rect x=\"60\" y=\"220\" width=\"180\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"150\" y=\"247\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">IR</text>\n          <rect x=\"60\" y=\"290\" width=\"180\" height=\"44\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"150\" y=\"317\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Instruction decoder</text>\n          <rect x=\"330\" y=\"120\" width=\"190\" height=\"220\" rx=\"8\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"425\" y=\"222\" font-size=\"16\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Encoder</text>\n          <text x=\"425\" y=\"244\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">AND–OR logic</text>\n          <text x=\"375\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Condition</text>\n          <text x=\"375\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">codes</text>\n          <text x=\"475\" y=\"64\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">External</text>\n          <text x=\"475\" y=\"82\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">inputs (MFC)</text>\n          <text x=\"284\" y=\"144\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">T1 … Tn</text>\n          <text x=\"284\" y=\"304\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">INS1 … INSm</text>\n          <g style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\">\n            <line x1=\"110\" y1=\"38\" x2=\"110\" y2=\"57\" marker-end=\"url(#ar45)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"20\" y1=\"82\" x2=\"57\" y2=\"82\" marker-end=\"url(#ar45)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"127\" marker-end=\"url(#ar45)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"240\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"327\" y2=\"152\" marker-end=\"url(#ar45)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"264\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"287\" marker-end=\"url(#ar45)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"240\" y1=\"312\" x2=\"327\" y2=\"312\" marker-end=\"url(#ar45)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"375\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"375\" y2=\"117\" marker-end=\"url(#ar45)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"475\" y1=\"92\" x2=\"475\" y2=\"117\" marker-end=\"url(#ar45)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"520\" y1=\"140\" x2=\"590\" y2=\"140\" marker-end=\"url(#ar45)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"520\" y1=\"170\" x2=\"590\" y2=\"170\" marker-end=\"url(#ar45)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"520\" y1=\"200\" x2=\"590\" y2=\"200\" marker-end=\"url(#ar45)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"520\" y1=\"260\" x2=\"590\" y2=\"260\" marker-end=\"url(#ar45)\"/>\n            <path d=\"M520,322 H690 V16 H190 V57\" marker-end=\"url(#ar45)\"/>\n          </g>\n          <line x1=\"520\" y1=\"230\" x2=\"590\" y2=\"230\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2.5\" marker-end=\"url(#ar45b)\"/>\n          <text x=\"598\" y=\"145\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">PCout</text>\n          <text x=\"598\" y=\"175\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">MARin</text>\n          <text x=\"598\" y=\"205\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">Read</text>\n          <text x=\"598\" y=\"235\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\">Zin</text>\n          <text x=\"598\" y=\"265\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">Zout</text>\n          <text x=\"598\" y=\"292\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"currentColor\">…</text>\n          <text x=\"560\" y=\"314\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">End</text>\n          <text x=\"425\" y=\"374\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"middle\" style=\"fill:var(--live)\">Zin = T1 + T6·ADD + T4·(BR + BRN)</text>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption><b>Figure 4.5.1</b> Organisation of a hardwired control unit. The step decoder says \"which step\", the instruction decoder says \"which instruction\", and the encoder's gates turn these, with the flags and MFC, into each control signal. End loops back to reset the counter for the next fetch; Run stops it during a memory wait.</figcaption>\n      </figure>",
 "6": "<figure class=\"fig\">\n        <svg viewBox=\"0 0 720 380\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Microprogrammed control unit: IR feeds the starting and branch address generator, which also takes condition codes and external inputs; it loads the microprogram counter, which addresses the control store; the microinstruction read out has a control-signal field sent to the datapath and condition-select and next-address fields fed back to the generator.\">\n          <defs>\n            <marker id=\"ar46\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto-start-reverse\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" style=\"fill:var(--accent)\"/></marker>\n          </defs>\n          <rect x=\"200\" y=\"20\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"280\" y=\"45\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">IR (opcode)</text>\n          <rect x=\"170\" y=\"96\" width=\"220\" height=\"56\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--accent-soft);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"280\" y=\"120\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Starting and branch</text>\n          <text x=\"280\" y=\"140\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"600\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">address generator</text>\n          <text x=\"88\" y=\"106\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Condition codes</text>\n          <text x=\"88\" y=\"136\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">External inputs</text>\n          <rect x=\"200\" y=\"184\" width=\"160\" height=\"40\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"280\" y=\"209\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">μPC</text>\n          <text x=\"150\" y=\"209\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"end\" fill=\"currentColor\">Clock</text>\n          <rect x=\"160\" y=\"254\" width=\"240\" height=\"64\" rx=\"6\" style=\"fill:var(--panel);stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"280\" y=\"280\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Control store (ROM)</text>\n          <text x=\"280\" y=\"302\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">all microroutines</text>\n          <text x=\"512\" y=\"252\" font-size=\"13\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">Microinstruction</text>\n          <rect x=\"440\" y=\"262\" width=\"264\" height=\"40\" style=\"fill:var(--live-soft);stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <line x1=\"584\" y1=\"262\" x2=\"584\" y2=\"302\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <line x1=\"640\" y1=\"262\" x2=\"640\" y2=\"302\" style=\"stroke:var(--live);stroke-width:2\"/>\n          <text x=\"512\" y=\"287\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">control signals</text>\n          <text x=\"612\" y=\"287\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">cond</text>\n          <text x=\"672\" y=\"287\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">next</text>\n          <text x=\"530\" y=\"114\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">next address</text>\n          <text x=\"500\" y=\"158\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">condition select</text>\n          <text x=\"512\" y=\"356\" font-size=\"13\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"currentColor\">to the datapath: PCout, MARin, Read, …</text>\n          <g style=\"fill:none;stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:2\">\n            <line x1=\"280\" y1=\"60\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"93\" marker-end=\"url(#ar46)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"24\" y1=\"114\" x2=\"167\" y2=\"114\" marker-end=\"url(#ar46)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"24\" y1=\"144\" x2=\"167\" y2=\"144\" marker-end=\"url(#ar46)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"280\" y1=\"152\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"181\" marker-end=\"url(#ar46)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"156\" y1=\"204\" x2=\"197\" y2=\"204\" marker-end=\"url(#ar46)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"280\" y1=\"224\" x2=\"280\" y2=\"251\" marker-end=\"url(#ar46)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"400\" y1=\"282\" x2=\"437\" y2=\"282\" marker-end=\"url(#ar46)\"/>\n            <line x1=\"512\" y1=\"302\" x2=\"512\" y2=\"334\" marker-end=\"url(#ar46)\"/>\n            <path d=\"M672,262 V122 H393\" marker-end=\"url(#ar46)\"/>\n            <path d=\"M612,262 V140 H393\" marker-end=\"url(#ar46)\"/>\n          </g>\n        </svg>\n        <figcaption><b>Figure 4.6.1</b> Organisation of a microprogrammed control unit. Each clock, μPC addresses one word of the control store. The word's control-signal field drives the datapath; its condition-select and next-address fields go back to the address generator, which chooses the next μPC value (increment, branch, or the start of a new microroutine from the opcode).</figcaption>\n      </figure>"
}